# scratchpad/ is the sanctioned EXCEPTION and is deliberately TRACKED:
# ten files that committed content depends on. tui-lab/ is named by path
# in docs/plans/2026-08-07-tui-v6.md, where "the lab's five scenarios run
# and pass" is a completion criterion, and release-smoke.mjs runs them;
# release-smoke.mjs is itself cited from packages/tui-cells (its 40/46
# crash widths are why a shipped test carries those constants); and
# a3-repro.py is named as the origin of the cell model in
# packages/tui/tests/a7-replay.test.ts. Untracking any of them would turn
# a checkable claim into a dangling one, so the comment above names what
# it actually covers instead (TUI2-R2pre ⑥, audit #6).
